find in Our way any alteration.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":77,"sd":null},{"k":"17:78","t":"Establish prayer at the decline of the sun [from its meridian] until the darkness of the night and [also] the Qur’ān [i.e., recitation] of dawn. Indeed, the recitation of dawn is ever witnessed.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":78,"sd":null},{"k":"17:79","t":"And from [part of] the night, pray with it [i.e., recitation of the Qur’ān] as additional [worship] for you; it is expected that your Lord will resurrect you to a praised station.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":79,"sd":null},{"k":"17:80","t":"And say, \"My Lord, cause me to enter a sound entrance and to exit a sound exit and grant me from Yourself a supporting authority.\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":80,"sd":null},{"k":"17:81","t":"And say, \"Truth has come, and falsehood has departed. Indeed is falsehood, [by nature], ever bound to depart.\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":81,"sd":null},{"k":"17:82","t":"And We send down of the Qur’ān that which is healing and mercy for the believers, but it does not increase the wrongdoers except in loss.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":82,"sd":null},{"k":"17:83","t":"And when We bestow favor upon man [i.e., the disbeliever], he turns away and distances himself; and when evil touches him, he is ever despairing.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":83,"sd":null},{"k":"17:84","t":"Say, \"Each works according to his manner, but your Lord is most knowing of who is best guided in way.\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":84,"sd":null},{"k":"17:85","t":"And they ask you, [O Muḥammad], about the soul. Say, \"The soul is of the affair [i.e., concern] of my Lord. And you [i.e., mankind] have not been given of knowledge except a little.\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":85,"sd":null},{"k":"17:86","t":"And if We willed, We could surely do away with that which We revealed to you. Then you would not find for yourself concerning it an advocate against Us.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":86,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":29,"surahs":[17],"sajdah":false}